my rotten brain cannot recall them right now. Wish I had my 'Dick
Best'
option/module list handy, but that was lost with all of my other good
stuff
during a DEC office move.

I even got to work on a 7-track TU10 tape drive once (I think it was
on one
of the PDP15s).

Rumor was that the TS11 was originally called the TS04 but it got such
a bad reputation before even shipping they renamed it the TS11.

