TiHKAL wrote:
> Carsten Gester <pentyern_nospam@gmx.net> wrote in message news:<a4j5bk$kju$1@tyfon.itea.ntnu.no>...
> 
>>As far as I know you have no chance booting Tru64  with an Adaptec SCSI 
>>controller. You have to buy a QLogic controller (1040B I think). I've done 
>>the same for my PWS433a and after I installed the controller I had no 
>>problems runnning Tru64.
>>
