> 
> yes but as I said before according to the Digital docs on the a/au
> series. They BOTH had qlogic controllers, not adaptec. This is what is
> confusing me.

You are probably looking at the wrong docs. 600a/au isn't neccessarily
equals 600a/au.

All of the 600au had Qlogic host adapter, the earlier models cam with a
PCI card, later models had the Qlogic chip on the motherboard. The 600a
came with either Qlogic or Adaptec host adapter. Be careful about these
a/au docs. Digital changed the hardware specs a few times on these
machines (moving the Qlogic chip onto the motherboard is one example)
and you have to know your systems part number precisly to find the
correct documentation.

	Dirk



