You'll need to find out which controller you have
(RQDX1, RQDX2, or RQDX3 most likely)

If you have an RQDX3 you will be able to use a RD50,
RD51, RD52, or RD53.  The drive will probably need to
be formatted by the correct controller, as there are
some differences.  The formatter is only available in
the field service diagonstics, which were not available
to the typical owner.

A MicroVax 2000 could usually format them for the
MicroVax II, but sometimes that didn't always work.




